{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06572","headline":"田家杂兴八首 八 · 储光羲","name":"田家杂兴八首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种桑百余树，种黍三十亩。\n衣食既有余，时时会亲友。\n夏来菰米饭，秋至菊花酒。\n孺人喜逢迎，稚子解趋走。\n日暮闲园里，团团荫榆柳。\n酩酊乘夜归，凉风吹户牖。\n清浅望河汉，低昂看北斗。\n数瓮犹未开，明朝能饮否。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}